---
onetaskgraph_template: 1
description: A task this host dispatches, in the layout every plan task here carries.
variables:
  what:
    description: >-
      The change, stated concretely enough that the worker can act on it without guessing:
      what to build or alter, where, and what it must not touch.
    type: text
    required: true
  why:
    description: >-
      The user's motivation for the change, in the user's own terms: what the worker and
      its judge weigh a trade-off against.
    type: text
    required: true
  additional_info:
    description: >-
      The task's own notes and grants, rendered under `## Additional info` above this host's
      operational notes: context the worker needs that is not a criterion, and any carve-out
      the operational notes say only a task may grant. Leave empty when there is none.
    type: text
    default: ""
  spikes:
    description: >-
      The spikes this task builds on, one object per spike with three string keys: `spike`
      (the spike's node id, `spike-<topic>`), `report` (the document id of its report,
      `<spike id>-report`, a document of this plan's own project) and `branch` (the
      preserved branch its harness is kept on, ending `/<spike id>`, or `/<spike id>-<n>`
      where a retry of the spike cut its own). Rendered as a `## Spike
      evidence` section, so the worker starts from the measurements and the harness. Leave
      empty when the task builds on no spike.
    type: list
    items: object
    default: []
---
{% extends "onepipeline/plan-task.md.j2" %}
{% block before_criteria %}
## What

{{ what }}

## Why

{{ why }}

{% endblock %}
{% block after_criteria %}
{% if spikes %}

## Spike evidence

This task builds on these spikes. Start from each report's measurements and from the
harness on each branch rather than measuring again. A report is the document of this plan's
own project with that id or, on a copy of the plan, the one whose `onetaskgraph.origin`
names it:

{% for entry in spikes %}
- `{{ entry.spike }}`: report `{{ entry.report }}`, a document of this plan's own project; branch `{{ entry.branch }}`
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if additional_info %}

## Additional info

{{ additional_info }}
{% endif %}

{% include "dispatch-appendix.md" %}
{% endblock %}
